<Base title="About" description="Why cannedlatte.com exists and how the numbers are gathered.">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p class="lede">Canned lattes went from a novelty to a fridge staple in about three years, and nobody was keeping score. This site does.</p>
  <p>Every product here is a record in a database: caffeine, sugar, protein, milk, can size, price, where it's sold. The rankings on this site are sorted from that data, not written by hand, so when a brand reformulates or a new can launches, every page updates at once.</p>
  <p>Numbers start from labels, brand sites and press releases. We buy and photograph each can as we go and mark records as verified once we've checked them against the label in hand. Each product page shows when its specs were last updated.</p>
  <p>Run by Sarah from the Chicago suburbs, who drinks more of these than is reasonable.</p>
</Base>
